<p class="lesson-lead">Platforming, from the inside: a physics flick, an honest ground check, and the three mercy timers that make controls feel tight. The unit's studio day builds the Gauntlet — the first level you design for strangers.</p>

<h2>Lessons</h2>
<table>
    <tr><th>ID</th><th>Title</th><th>What you build / learn</th></tr>
